{
 "_comment": "Drive: a modern electronic pulse for a product launch, A minor (Am F C G), 120 bpm. Builds over the solo shots (kick on 1 and 3, then claps and offbeat hats), holds its breath for one beat before each grid, and lands each grid on a stab, a boom and a crash; the hook enters with the 3x3, the glockenspiel and a 16th-note pluck with the 4x4. Patterns restart at each grid (every drop is the tonic) and run on across the solo shots. Instruments are the FluidR3 GM set (_sketchaudio.py), drums and effects synthesised there.",
